(1855, 'Nuvesta LEGEND WOMEN', 'nuvesta-legend-women', '<p>The <strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"81\">Nuvesta LEGEND WOMEN</strong> T-Shirt is designed for women who value both comfort and style. Made from premium-quality breathable cotton fabric, it offers a soft feel, modern fit, and all-day comfort. Perfect for casual outings, daily wear, travel, or light activities, this versatile T-shirt is an essential addition to every wardrobe.</p>', '<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"783\">Upgrade your everyday style with the <strong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"481\">Nuvesta LEGEND WOMEN</strong> T-Shirt, crafted to deliver premium comfort and timeless fashion. Designed with soft, breathable cotton fabric, this T-shirt keeps you cool and comfortable throughout the day. Its lightweight construction and flattering women\'s fit provide unrestricted movement while maintaining a stylish appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"1140\">Whether you\'re heading to work, meeting friends, traveling, or relaxing at home, the LEGEND WOMEN T-Shirt complements every occasion. The durable stitching and premium-quality fabric ensure long-lasting performance, while the classic round neck and short sleeves create a clean, modern look that pairs effortlessly with jeans, leggings, skirts, or shorts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1306\">Available in multiple attractive colors and sizes, the <strong data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1221\">Nuvesta LEGEND WOMEN</strong> T-Shirt combines quality, elegance, and everyday functionality in one perfect piece.</p>', '<table class=\"table\" style=\"height: 181.094px; width: 101.648%;\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 9.0184%; height: 22.3906px;\">Size</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 24.2231%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Chest (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 26.4526%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Length (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 30.