(1856, 'Nuvesta POLO SHIRT', 'nuvesta-polo-shirt', '<p>The <strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"77\">Nuvesta Polo Shirt</strong> combines premium comfort with a timeless, sophisticated look. Made from high-quality breathable fabric, it offers a soft feel, regular fit, and all-day comfort, making it perfect for casual wear, office attire, travel, and everyday use.</p>', '<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"600\">Experience effortless style with the <strong data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"404\">Nuvesta Polo Shirt</strong>, designed for those who appreciate comfort and elegance. Crafted from premium cotton pique fabric, this polo shirt provides excellent breathability, durability, and a soft touch against the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"970\">Featuring a classic polo collar with a button placket, short sleeves, and a modern regular fit, the Nuvesta Polo Shirt delivers a polished appearance suitable for both casual and semi-formal occasions. Whether you\'re at work, attending an event, traveling, or enjoying a weekend outing, this versatile polo shirt keeps you looking sharp while ensuring maximum comfort.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1195\">Built with premium stitching and fade-resistant fabric, the Nuvesta Polo Shirt is designed to maintain its quality and shape wash after wash. Pair it effortlessly with jeans, chinos, or trousers for a refined everyday look.</p>', '<table class=\"table\" style=\"height: 181.094px; width: 101.648%;\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 9.0184%; height: 22.3906px;\">Size</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 24.2231%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Chest (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 26.4526%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Length (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 30.4861%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Shoulder (Inch)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 39.6719px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.0184%; he