(1857, 'Nuvesta Women Polo Shirt', 'nuvesta-women-polo-shirt', '<p>The <strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"89\">Nuvesta Women Polo Shirt</strong> is designed for women who appreciate comfort, elegance, and everyday versatility. Crafted from premium breathable cotton pique fabric, it features a flattering fit, classic polo collar, and soft texture, making it ideal for casual outings, office wear, and active lifestyles.</p>', '<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"643\">Refresh your wardrobe with the <strong data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"454\">Nuvesta Women Polo Shirt</strong>, where timeless style meets exceptional comfort. Made from high-quality cotton pique fabric, this polo shirt is soft, breathable, and lightweight, ensuring all-day comfort in every season.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"939\">Designed specifically for women, it features a flattering regular fit that enhances your silhouette without compromising on comfort. The classic polo collar, button placket, and short sleeves create a sophisticated yet casual look suitable for work, travel, sports, college, or weekend outings.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1226\">The premium fabric resists fading and maintains its shape even after repeated washing, while the reinforced stitching ensures long-lasting durability. Whether paired with jeans, trousers, skirts, or leggings, the <strong data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1182\">Nuvesta Women Polo Shirt</strong> offers effortless style for every occasion.</p>', '<table class=\"table\" style=\"height: 181.094px; width: 101.648%;\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 9.0184%; height: 22.3906px;\">Size</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 24.2231%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Chest (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 26.4526%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Length (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 30.4861%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Shoulder (Inch)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</