(1858, 'Nuvesta  Kid\'s Jersey T-Shirt', 'nuvesta-kids-jersey-t-shirt', '<p>The <strong data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"85\">Nuvesta Jersey T-Shirt</strong> is crafted for superior comfort and performance. Made from lightweight, breathable jersey fabric with moisture-wicking technology, it keeps you cool, dry, and comfortable during sports, workouts, outdoor activities, or everyday wear.</p>', '<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"583\">Stay comfortable and perform at your best with the <strong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"426\">Nuvesta Jersey T-Shirt</strong>. Designed using premium-quality polyester jersey fabric, this T-shirt offers excellent breathability, quick-drying performance, and long-lasting durability.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"882\">Its lightweight construction and athletic regular fit provide unrestricted movement, making it perfect for running, cycling, football, cricket, gym workouts, training sessions, and casual wear. The moisture-wicking fabric helps absorb sweat and dries quickly, keeping you fresh throughout the day.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"1176\">Featuring a classic round neck, short sleeves, and reinforced stitching, the <strong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"987\">Nuvesta Jersey T-Shirt</strong> combines modern style with high-performance functionality. Whether you\'re on the field, at the gym, or enjoying an active lifestyle, this jersey is built to deliver comfort and confidence</p>', '<table class=\"table\" style=\"height: 181.094px; width: 101.648%;\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 9.0184%; height: 22.3906px;\">Size</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 24.2231%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Chest (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 26.4526%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Length (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 30.4861%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Shoulder (Inch)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 