(1859, 'Nuvesta NITRO ZIP JACKET', 'nuvesta-nitro-zip-jacket', '<p>The <strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"89\">Nuvesta NITRO ZIP JACKET</strong> is a premium lightweight jacket designed for everyday comfort and active lifestyles. Featuring a full-front zipper, breathable fabric, and a modern athletic fit, it provides warmth without bulk, making it perfect for casual wear, travel, workouts, and outdoor activities.</p>', '<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"658\">Stay stylish and comfortable with the <strong data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"457\">Nuvesta NITRO ZIP JACKET</strong>, a versatile outerwear essential for every season. Crafted from premium-quality performance fabric, this jacket offers a soft feel, lightweight warmth, and excellent breathability for all-day comfort.</p>\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"997\">Designed with a sleek full-zip closure, stand-up collar, ribbed cuffs, and secure side pockets, the NITRO ZIP JACKET delivers a modern athletic look while providing practical functionality. Its flexible fabric allows unrestricted movement, making it ideal for commuting, gym sessions, outdoor adventures, travel, or casual everyday wear.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1300\">Built with durable stitching and fade-resistant materials, this jacket maintains its premium appearance even after repeated use and washing. Whether layered over a T-shirt or paired with jeans, joggers, or sportswear, the <strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1249\">Nuvesta NITRO ZIP JACKET</strong> offers the perfect blend of performance and style.</p>', '<table class=\"table\" style=\"height: 181.094px; width: 101.648%;\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 9.0184%; height: 22.3906px;\">Size</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 24.2231%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Chest (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 26.4526%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Length (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 30.4861%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"