(1860, 'Nuvesta POLYCOTTON POLO', 'nuvesta-polycotton-polo', '<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"300\">The <strong data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"87\">Nuvesta Polycotton Polo</strong> combines the softness of cotton with the durability of polyester, delivering all-day comfort, breathability, and a smart casual look. Perfect for office wear, corporate uniforms, casual outings, and everyday use.</p>', '<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"619\">Elevate your everyday style with the <strong data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"394\">Nuvesta Polycotton Polo</strong>, designed for those who value comfort, durability, and a polished appearance. Made from a premium polycotton blend, this polo shirt offers the natural softness of cotton with the strength and wrinkle resistance of polyester.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"930\">The breathable fabric keeps you comfortable throughout the day, while its moisture-management properties help maintain freshness during work or outdoor activities. Featuring a classic polo collar, button placket, and a modern regular fit, this polo shirt is suitable for both casual and professional settings.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"1165\">With reinforced stitching and fade-resistant fabric, the <strong data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1016\">Nuvesta Polycotton Polo</strong> retains its shape and color even after repeated washing. Pair it effortlessly with jeans, chinos, or formal trousers for a clean and confident look.</p>', '<table class=\"table\" style=\"height: 181.094px; width: 101.648%;\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 22.3906px;\">\r\n<th style=\"width: 9.0184%; height: 22.3906px;\">Size</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 24.2231%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Chest (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 26.4526%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Length (Inch)</th>\r\n<th style=\"width: 30.4861%; height: 22.3906px;\" align=\"right\">Shoulder (Inch)</th>\