(615, 1331, 'Battery Life', 'The 10-day maximum battery life is tested under the following conditions:<br />\n30 minutes of Bluetooth calling per week, 30 minutes of music playback per week, heart rate monitoring always on, HUAWEI TruSleep™ enabled at night, 90 minutes of exercise on average per week (GPS enabled), message notifications enabled (50 messages, 6 calls, and 3 alarms per day), and the device screen turned on 200 times per day<br />\n<br />\nThe 7-day typical battery life is tested under the following conditions:<br />\n30 minutes of Bluetooth calling per week, 30 minutes of music playback per week, heart rate monitoring always on, HUAWEI TruSleep™ enabled at night, stress detection and auto SpO₂ measurement enabled, 180 minutes of exercise on average per week (GPS enabled), message notifications turned on (50 messages, 6 calls, and 3 alarms per day), and the device screen turned on for a total of 30 minutes per day.\"<br />\n<br />\nThe 4-day battery life with AOD enabled is tested under the following conditions:<br />\nAOD enabled, 30 minutes of Bluetooth calling per week, 30 minutes of music playback per week, heart rate monitoring always on, HUAWEI TruSleep™ enabled at night, stress detection and auto SpO₂ measurement enabled, 180 minutes of exercise on average per week (GPS enabled), message notifications turned on (50 messages, 6 calls, and 3 alarms per day), and the device screen turned on for a total of 30 minutes per day.<br />\n400 mAh large-capacity battery', NULL, 8, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2024-12-30 11:00:43', '2025-01-12 19:20:13'),
