(1525, 1410, 'Overview & features', 'Say Goodbye to Double click - Just one click on “2X Button” straightly open files and programs easily. Without any driver, save times & improve efficiency.<br />\n<br />\n5 M Clicks Button Lifetime - Extreme quality offer over 5 million clicks guaranteed.<br />\n<br />\n1000 DPI -Guaranteed smooth and accurate tracking anywhere, even on furry textiles. Throw away your mouse pad!<br />\n<br />\nDust-Resistant Wheel - Dust-Resistant design prolong wheel life-span.<br />\n<br />\n4-Way Wheel -Smart horizontal & vertical scrolling.', NULL, 2, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-09 18:50:06', '2025-01-09 18:54:05'),
