(1738, 1435, 'Overview & features', 'Pair up to 4 Devices: Interchange and connect up to 3 devices with Bluetooth connection and 1 device with 2.4GHz.<br />\n<br />\nDual Connectivity Mode: [BT+2.4GHz] Features Bluetooth and 2.4GHz connection<br />\n<br />\nSmooth Scissor Switch Keys Structure: Each keystroke will be rewarded with a smooth tactile response from Scissor Key Switch Keycaps. Calibrated precision, 1.5mm actuation point, less key chatter.<br />\n<br />\nRechargeable Desig: Charge with the Type-C USB connector in the package. It requires approximately 2.5 hours to be fully charged.<br />\n<br />\nLow-Profile Chocolate Keycaps-Ultra-slim chocolate style keycap structure allows for a comfortable typing experience, best for long work hours.<br />\n<br />\nCompact & Trendy: Compact size of 86 keys, great space-saving keyboard.', NULL, 2, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-14 20:53:34', '2025-01-14 20:58:00'),
