(1989, 1386, 'Pro Stand', 'Height adjustment: the system allows for a total height adjustment of 120 millimetres (60 millimetres in each direction from the midpoint)<br />\nOrientation: landscape or portrait<br />\nTilt: –5° to +25°<br />\nPro Stand is sold separately.<br />\n<br />\nDisplay with stand size and weight<br />\n<br />\nDepth (tilt 25°): 27.8cm<br />\nWeight: 11.78kg2<br />\nLandscape orientation<br />\nWidth: 71.8cm<br />\nHeight in top position: 65.3cm<br />\nHeight in bottom position: 53.3cm<br />\nPortrait orientation<br />\nWidth: 41.2cm<br />\nHeight in top position: 80.6cm<br />\nStand size and weight<br />\nWidth: 18.0cm<br />\nHeight (arm 0º, tilt 0º): 43.3cm<br />\nDepth: 23.6cm<br />\nHeight (arm 45º, tilt 25º): 49.7cm<br />\nWeight: 4.3kg2<br />\nAttach and detach<br />\n<br />\nEffortlessly attaches and detaches for quick and easy transportation. The puck-shaped magnetic connector is designed to attach to the back of the display and locks Pro Stand and the display together. To detach, simply unlock the slider and tilt the display far back to release the magnets, then lift the display off Pro Stand.', NULL, 10, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-01-17 09:07:48', '2025-01-17 09:07:48'),
