(3905, 1581, 'Overview', 'Magic Mouse is wireless and rechargeable, with an optimized foot design that lets it glide smoothly across your desk. The Multi-Touch surface allows you to perform simple gestures such as swiping between web pages and scrolling through documents.<br />\n<br />\nThe rechargeable battery will power your Magic Mouse for about a month or more between charges. It’s ready to go right out of the box and pairs automatically with your Mac.<br />\n<br />\nIt features a USB-C port and includes a woven USB-C Charge Cable that lets you pair and charge by connecting to a USB-C port on your Mac, so you can charge all of your favorite devices with just a single cable.', NULL, 2, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-11 08:02:20', '2025-03-11 08:02:20'),
