(4315, 1609, 'Support', 'Display: Simultaneously supports full native resolution on the built-in display at 1 billion colors and:<br />\nUp to two external displays with up to 6K resolution at 60Hz<br />\nThunderbolt 4 digital video output<br />\nSupport for native DisplayPort 1.4 output over USB-C<br />\n<br />\nVideo Playback: Supported formats include HEVC, H.264, AV1, and ProRes<br />\nHDR with Dolby Vision, HDR10+/HDR10, and HLG<br />\n<br />\nAudio Playback: Supported formats include AAC, MP3, Apple Lossless, FLAC,<br />\nDolby Digital, Dolby Digital Plus, and Dolby Atmos', NULL, 13, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-16 11:34:34', '2025-03-16 11:34:34'),
