(4343, 1612, 'Full Features', 'CUSTOMIZABLE REAR PADDLES-<br />\nKeep your thumbs on the sticks and play with faster reactions thanks to these two ergonomically placed rear paddles. Assign practically any function to these paddles to suit your in-game preference.<br />\n<br />\nSUPERIOR ERGONOMICS-<br />\nNomad is designed to fit naturally in your hands due to its traditional controller shape and size. Utilizing our proven ergonomics, Nomad has a full-size grip so you can play longer and better<br />\n<br />\nANTI-DRIFT THUMBSTICKS-<br />\nOur anti-drift Hall effect thumbstick are less likely to get stick drift and are built to last. They are full sized and provide enhanced grip, comfort, and the option to customize.<br />\n<br />\nBATTERY LIFE-<br />\nPlay your favorite controller supported games for up to 16 hours without worrying about draining your phone’s battery. A USB-C cable is included for charging to get you back in the game in 20 minutes.<br />\n<br />\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR GAMEPLAY-<br />\nChange your paddle inputs, fine-tune the thumbstick’s sensitivity, adjust your triggers, and more in our subscription free app. Save profiles in the app for ease when switching between games. <br />\n<br />\nTHOUSANDS OF GAMES IN YOUR HANDS-<br />\nThe free SCUF app allows you to play your favorite controller supported games on the go.<br />\n<br />\nRECORD AND SHARE-<br />\nEffortlessly showcase your plays with a single button. Use the SCUF Button to capture screenshots and record your gameplay, streamlining the process of highlighting your impressive plays with ease.', NULL, 2, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-16 14:59:25', '2025-03-16 14:59:25'),
(4344, 1612, 'Technical Specification', 'Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.0<br />\nWireless Range: Up to 45 feet/12m<br />\nCompatibility: iPhone iOS 16+<br />\n(Not compatible with Android)<br />\nPorts: USB-C<br />\nThumbstick Layout: Symmetrical<br />\nDimensions: 202 x 101 x 51 mm /7.95” x 3.98” x 2.01” inches', NULL, 3, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-16 14:59:25', '2025-03-16 14:59:25'),
(4345, 1612, 'Warranty', '1- Year (12 months)', NULL, 4, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-16 14:59:25', '2025-03-16 14:59:25'),
(4346, 1612, 'Additional Info.', 'Country Of Origin: USA<br />\nMade in: China<br />\n<br />\nIn Box: 1x SCUF Nomad Performance Mobile<br />\n2x Additional Thumbsticks Grips iPhone 14/15 Adapter<br />\n1x USB-C Cable', NULL, 5, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-16 14:59:25', '2025-03-16 14:59:25'),
(4347, 1613, 'General', 'Model: SCUF Envision PC Gaming Controller<br />\nPart No.:603-178-01-001-NA<br />\nColor: Black', NULL, 1, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-16 15:28:35', '2025-03-16 15:32:01'),
(4348, 1613, 'Full Features', 'CUSTOMIZABLE REAR PADDLES-<br />\nKeep your thumbs on the thumbsticks while you jump, slide, reload, and more. Assign practically any controller function to these paddles to suit your in-game preference. Your aim will thank you.<br />\n<br />\nINTERCHANGEABLE THUMBSTICKS-<br />\nChange your thumbstick height and shape to a short and concave thumbstick to dig in making quick moves even faster. Swap to a tall and domed thumbstick for a wider range of motion and more precision.<br />\n<br />\nFULLY PROGRAMMABLE G-KEYS-<br />\nFive on-board buttons ready for any function you need. From simple Windows shortcuts to advanced macros, you can map practically any keyboard or controller function to these G-Keys.<br />\n<br />\nSIDE-ACTION (SAX) BUTTONS-<br />\nThese two uniquely placed, side-mounted buttons fit the natural placement of your fingers and give you two more inputs to customize. Easily remove them if you want to play without them.<br />\n<br />\nOMRON™ MECHANICAL SWITCHES-<br />\nFeel and hear the difference. OMRON™ mechanical switches have a mouse click for a crisp sound with faster activation times. Your Envision features these switches on the ABXY face buttons and the D-Pad. <br />\n<br />\nCUSTOMIZATION SOFTWARE-<br />\nSave your controller inputs, fine-tune the thumbstick’s sensitivity, adjust your trigger response curves, and more to the hardware mode. Or utilize iCUE for advanced macros, save more profiles, and have total control on your PC.', NULL, 2, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-16 15:28:35', '2025-03-16 15:32:32'),
(4349, 1613, 'Technical Specification', 'Technical Specification<br />\nConnectivity: Wired<br />\nCable Length: 6ft/2m<br />\nCompatibility: Windows 10/11<br />\n(Not compatible with Mac or iOS)<br />\nPorts: USB-C, 3.5mm Stereo Headset Jack<br />\nThumbstick Layout: Symmetrical<br />\nDimensions: 165 x 107.5 x 63.5mm', NULL, 3, 0.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-16 15:28:35', '2025-03-16 15:33:08'),
